  <p id="c-nanqishu-005-zijing-an:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">延興元年</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-005-zijing-an:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">九月癸酉</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-005-zijing-an:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">遣平西將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-zijing-an:p003:m0005" ref="m4d_lon_pyg">王廣之</persName>誅南兖州刺史安陸王<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-zijing-an:p003:m0017" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子敬</persName>。於是江州刺史晉安王<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-zijing-an:p003:m0029" ref="ltu_nhs_gk6">子懋</persName>起兵，遣中護軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-zijing-an:p003:m0038" ref="hgq_k4y_crp">王玄邈</persName>討之。</p>
</text>
